This package ports the semantics of the methods lower, higher, linear and
inverted_cdf of numpy.quantile in NumPy 2.5.4, including the _lerp of its
linear method, and of numpy.sum and numpy.mean, Copyright (c) NumPy Developers, BSD 3-Clause License,
https://github.com/numpy/numpy. The package does not include NumPy's code.
The names of the percentile bootstrap follow SciPy (scipy.stats.bootstrap)
and arch (arch.bootstrap.IIDBootstrap); the package includes no code of
either.
The pairwise sum comes from @stdlib/blas-ext-base-gsumpw, a dependency
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/stdlib-js/stdlib).
